                      <path d="M 45 10 Q 55 12, 60 20 Q 65 25, 75 30 Q 80 40, 70 50 Q 75 60, 68 75 Q 60 85, 55 90 Q 50 82, 45 78 Q 40 70, 32 65 Q 25 60, 28 50 Q 30 40, 35 30 Q 32 20, 45 10 Z" />
